cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it."
title: "Simulators: grounded, auditable claim-verification for AI"
abstract: >
  Standard-library-only simulators and audits that ground AI claims
  in physics, thermodynamics, planetary balance, ecology, biomechanics,
  culture, and epistemic scope. Refutation-protocol-first: constants
  are frozen; when a test fails, the claim updates, not the constant.
authors:
